cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "The Causal Safety Audit: Code Repository"
abstract: >-
  Implementation of the Causal Safety Audit for deep-learning MRI
  reconstruction: additive counterfactual lesion insertion through the real
  multi-coil forward operator, filtered null-space projectors and transfer
  statistics, a channelised Hotelling observer readout, pre-specified erasure
  definitions, and the statistical analysis plan. No experiment has been run
  with this code at version 0.1.0.
